WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:17.175
Suddenly, Duman the storyteller threw his handkerchief in the air.

2
00:00:18.296 --> 00:00:21.318
He wanted to change the mood and amuse the guards.

3
00:00:22.398 --> 00:00:26.001
The men looked up and forgot about the children for a moment.

4
00:00:28.182 --> 00:00:30.224
"Run!" shouted Vinnie.

5
00:00:31.184 --> 00:00:33.686
Mandy grabbed her mother's earrings from the guard.

6
00:00:35.227 --> 00:00:37.469
Berk didn't have time to grab his silver.

7
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:40.851
The children ran out of the coffee shop.

8
00:00:42.252 --> 00:00:43.954
They thought the guards would chase them.

9
00:00:44.874 --> 00:00:47.817
The children ran up one street and down another.

10
00:00:48.897 --> 00:00:51.619
Finally they stopped, gasping for breath.

11
00:00:51.639 --> 00:00:55.822
"Do you hear that music?"

12
00:00:56.863 --> 00:00:57.584
said Mandy.

13
00:00:59.496 --> 00:01:00.956
"We can't stop to listen!"

14
00:01:01.577 --> 00:01:02.677
Berk said sharply.

15
00:01:02.697 --> 00:01:05.998
"I need to go back to the bazaar right away."

16
00:01:06.018 --> 00:01:09.859
"Wait just a minute," Mandy insisted.

17
00:01:11.259 --> 00:01:15.380
She and Vinnie walked toward the music, and Berk slowly followed.

18
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.901
"What's going on?"

19
00:01:19.561 --> 00:01:20.302
Mandy asked.

20
00:01:21.222 --> 00:01:24.463
They saw musicians and dancers in an open field.

21
00:01:25.363 --> 00:01:26.683
Food was being served.

22
00:01:27.244 --> 00:01:28.564
Everything smelled good.

23
00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:32.713
"A wrestling match is about to begin," said Berk.

24
00:01:32.733 --> 00:01:35.054
"Can we stay and watch?"

25
00:01:35.775 --> 00:01:36.435
asked Vinnie.

26
00:01:37.516 --> 00:01:39.236
Berk looked around nervously.

27
00:01:40.257 --> 00:01:42.278
He thought the guards might be nearby.

28
00:01:42.298 --> 00:01:44.159
"No, we shouldn't.

29
00:01:44.599 --> 00:01:47.780
These matches can last for days," Berk replied.

30
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:51.722
A loud horn signaled the beginning of the match.

31
00:01:53.183 --> 00:01:56.084
Two big men walked to the middle of the crowd.

32
00:01:56.908 --> 00:02:00.250
People cheered and shouted as they watched the wrestlers.

33
00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:04.791
"Please, we must leave," said Berk.

34
00:02:05.712 --> 00:02:08.433
He motioned for Vinnie and Mandy to follow him.

35
00:02:10.074 --> 00:02:11.975
They returned to the Grand Bazaar.

36
00:02:13.175 --> 00:02:15.816
Berk explained to his father what had happened.

37
00:02:15.836 --> 00:02:18.677
"The sultan's guards are fair men.

38
00:02:19.458 --> 00:02:21.939
They will give back the silver," said Ali.

39
00:02:21.959 --> 00:02:24.240
"Let me see the earrings."

40
00:02:25.364 --> 00:02:26.804
He took them from Mandy.

41
00:02:26.824 --> 00:02:28.665
"Where did you get these?"

42
00:02:29.305 --> 00:02:29.825
he asked.

43
00:02:29.845 --> 00:02:33.406
"They're my mother's," Mandy replied.

44
00:02:33.426 --> 00:02:35.407
"I didn't steal them."

45
00:02:36.507 --> 00:02:40.208
Ali looked at Mandy and said, "I'm worried about you."

46
00:02:41.688 --> 00:02:43.129
"Why?" asked Vinnie.

47
00:02:43.149 --> 00:02:48.330
"You are strangers and these earrings look expensive," said Ali.

48
00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:51.611
"The Janissary won't stop looking for you."

49
00:02:52.892 --> 00:02:54.332
Vinnie gulped loudly.

50
00:02:55.209 --> 00:02:57.931
"But we didn't do anything wrong!"

51
00:02:58.612 --> 00:02:59.273
he cried.

52
00:02:59.293 --> 00:03:03.417
"You took back the earrings and ran away," said Ali.

53
00:03:03.437 --> 00:03:05.859
"They think you are hiding something."

54
00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:09.382
Just then they heard loud voices.

55
00:03:09.402 --> 00:03:11.444
"They're here!"

56
00:03:12.105 --> 00:03:12.726
cried Berk.

57
00:03:13.186 --> 00:03:14.808
He hid behind his father.

58
00:03:15.989 --> 00:03:18.792
The guards from the coffee shop came into the bazaar.

59
00:03:19.868 --> 00:03:25.230
They stopped at every shop to look for the children behind curtains and under tables.

60
00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:29.151
"We have to go, Mandy," Vinnie said.

61
00:03:29.171 --> 00:03:30.711
"We can't stay here!"

62
00:03:30.731 --> 00:03:35.633
"Thank you for your help," Mandy said to Berk and his family.

63
00:03:36.733 --> 00:03:39.354
"We're sorry for any trouble we caused."

64
00:03:40.474 --> 00:03:43.255
"May Allah give you peace," said Berk.

65
00:03:44.215 --> 00:03:46.456
"Pray to Allah and all will be well."

66
00:03:47.868 --> 00:03:49.729
Vinnie and Mandy turned to leave.

67
00:03:50.249 --> 00:03:52.611
But Vinnie tripped over a carpet.

68
00:03:53.271 --> 00:03:56.713
He bumped into a table with colorful tiles on display.

69
00:03:57.773 --> 00:03:59.854
Everything fell with a loud crash.

70
00:03:59.874 --> 00:04:01.595
"There they are!"

71
00:04:02.155 --> 00:04:03.136
shouted the guards.

72
00:04:03.796 --> 00:04:04.937
"Stop, thieves!"
